  (xctrace 16.0, Xcode 26.6). Shapes copied from a real export: the first occurrence of a value
  carries id="N", later occurrences are back-references (<thread ref="N"/>). Row children are
  positional and follow the <schema> column order; the backtrace column is elided as <sentinel/>
